      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Medicine and surgery are able to resolve almost the whole painful symptomatology now, but they are not allowed to understand and explain the original essence of the pain itself. In this work the authors aim to emphasize the physio-pathological features of the pain considering such a problem as a psychosomatic question."},
